{"agent_id":"pp3g-MMlK-adversarial-review-of-the-tools-monorepo-migration","agent_seq":1,"timestamp":"2026-08-14T19:20:23.355172074Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"d9e6075b-9f5c-43d4-9d2f-e9c0bdf48b7a","comment_uuid":"8dc44fdf-8dc9-41c5-a6c0-c6b8bc88b199","author":"pp3g-MMlK-adversarial-review-of-the-tools-monorepo-migration","content":"Plan: independent adversarial review of the Tools monorepo migration plan (D1-D7 + 6-step implementation on #354). Approach: (1) read ontology #353 + analysis #354; (2) verify every drift claim against the filesystem — plugin versions (3-way diff), live wrappers vs Tools/scripts, tripn .ases boundary existence, TOOLING.md §16/STALE claims, hook-config.json divergence, rules drift; (3) assess the plan as a plan: correctness, completeness, safety, order-of-operations, drift-persistence; (4) deliver verdict as --kind result on #359 only. No file changes, no commits. Independence: will NOT read #358/#360 verdicts.","created_at":"2026-08-14T19:20:23.348394357Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:TbqAvGerjOwEcLKkPxec2/2AsovdzlvEEnC8pWhmLo4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgqsg/Gn8dfAb8BYU4ASgNeoFz2vpjh3MhGCnIoDuudbgAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAANbW2eE5pBLPERMAnPefeJTP6gGOSUmnYQUCDnsZbVqYV0FVWFk8qmOJ/cf6/mHakXdwaYu42jhVSrvnxuXoCw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:TbqAvGerjOwEcLKkPxec2/2AsovdzlvEEnC8pWhmLo4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgqsg/Gn8dfAb8BYU4ASgNeoFz2vpjh3MhGCnIoDuudbgAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCBnpOieddcUbGZCanQBEWZOi7awOP1Zczq7NKK7cZu1JiXgDefurvDJjZC3cwvTT3dsaf/DrWJv/3ohKxSSVwM="}
